      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>New menu bar panel: sync status, your folders and what happened lately.</li><li>Version History for Team files: right-click a file › Version History… to save or restore an earlier version.</li><li>Notifications when uploads finish, a share link is copied or a version is restored.</li><li>My files: a private folder only you can see.</li><li>The Library is sorted by client, then year (Content &#x27;26), then project.</li></ul>]]></description>
